From 65fe4aab21dbda141bd6b2f5e554627797c50582 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:23:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add Sony Bravia Infrared integration

Controls Sony Bravia TVs through an infrared emitter and fires events for
key presses picked up by an infrared receiver. Uses the SonyTVCode command
set from infrared-protocols, with button keys and event types named after
the library's codes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RrPaBaU6zM6AhoWcyUefct
